<Base title="Club event report">
  <h1>Club event report</h1>
  <p class="lead">After your event, tell the council how it went: attendance, and whether Hippo funded it.</p>
  <p class="demo-note">Demo: this form isn't built in the demo. On the real site it's a signed-in form, and the Community Relations Director can export the reports as a spreadsheet. To try a working form, see <a href={href('/room-booking/')}>Event &amp; room booking</a>.</p>
</Base>
